<section>
  <div class="wrap two two--top">
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><div><strong>Inquiry</strong><p>Send the form on the <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">contact page</a>, or call. Tell us your child's age and we reply with programs, dates and fees.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Meet and tour</strong><p>Visit, meet the teachers and see a class. Not in Hội An yet? We do it by video call. We also meet your child to see where their English is.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Trial days and forms</strong><p>Your child can try up to three days first. Then we send the enrollment packet: medical details, allergies, and who can collect your child.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Payment and welcome</strong><p>Pay the admission fee and first tuition. You get a welcome email and a Google Classroom invite, and we add a name to a class list.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="blob-wrap blob-wrap--green has-sticker"><span class="sticker sticker--green sticker--tr">Rolling admissions</span>{% photo "primary-students-clay-modelling", "photo--lg photo--tilt-r" %}</div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale faq">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2>Before you ask</h2>
    <details><summary>What documents do you need?</summary><p>The completed enrollment form, passport copies for your child and for the parents, and your child's most recent school report. If your child has a diagnosis or a learning support plan, please bring a copy so we can plan for it.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Will my child do an assessment?</summary><p>Not a test. Our academic team meets your child, usually during your visit, to see where their English and schoolwork are. With young children it is games and stories. Then we recommend a class.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How much English does my child need?</summary><p>Your child does not need fluent English. In Early Years and Primary, children with little English usually settle in quickly. In Secondary, a basic level makes the Cambridge classes much easier to follow. For the Global Program's academic and full-day pathways we decide case by case.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can we do a trial day?</summary><p>Yes, up to three. A trial day costs 1,600,000 VND, meals included, and if your child enrolls we take it off the tuition.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Are there deadlines, or can we join any time?</summary><p>You can join any time of year. If your child starts after the year has begun, tuition runs from their first day. Staying for a few weeks or months instead? That is the <a href="{{ '/learning/global-program/' | url }}">Global Program</a>.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

